================================================================================
TEAM ATTRIBUTION
================================================================================

AdaptIQ – AI-Powered Adaptive Learning Interface

Project Description:
AdaptIQ is an AI-powered platform designed to transform educational content
into multiple adaptive learning modes. It restructures complex learning
material into formats such as Read-Easy Mode, Focus Mode, Step-by-Step Mode,
Visual Mind Maps, and interactive quizzes to improve learning accessibility
for diverse cognitive styles.

Development Team:
- Arnav Patil – Team Lead &  Database Management
- Saqib Momin – Backend Development & API Integration
- Yash Gharunge – Frontend Development & UI/UX Design
- Param Pachore – Testing & Bug fixing

Project Repository:
https://github.com/SAQIB-dev7447/ADAPTIQ_.git

Project Category:
AI-powered Educational Accessibility Platform

