================================================================================
PROJECT DETAILS
================================================================================

Technology Stack:
- Backend: Python (Flask)
- Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Bootstrap
- Database: Supabase
- AI Models: Gemini Flash 2.5, Groq Llama
- Visualization: Mermaid.js

Project Status: MVP / Hackathon Prototype
Development Timeline: 2026 Hackathon Development Cycle
Last Updated: 2026
